end

case malformed expressions are refused when set, on moonrt
target moonrt
$ bp add 8000 if "A =="
out 85
Error: Condition 'A ==' refused: Unexpected '<end>' in expression. Nothing was added.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
$ bp add 8000 if nosuch==1
out 119
Error: Condition 'nosuch==1' refused: Unknown symbol 'nosuch'. Try `eval symbols` for the full list. Nothing was added.
status 1
action none
$ bp add 8000 log "A, (S"
out 89
Error: Log expression 'A, (S' refused: Expected ')' but found '<end>'. Nothing was added.
status 1
action none
$ bp cpu add 8000 if "S > > 1"
out 84
Error: Condition 'S > > 1' refused: Unexpected '>' in expression. Nothing was added.
status 1
action none
$ bp list
out 22
No active breakpoints.
status 0
action none
end

